          "derived": true
        }
      ],
      "parity": "match",
      "notes": "Derived tickets (strings: Int64 > 2^53): FNV-1a 64 over \"Thinkorswim|<trimmed fields joined by |>#0\", masked to 63 bits (SPEC §5.1 step 6); computed by the porter, not asserted in Swift."
